{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MX Racing World puts you in the adventure of high-speed offroad motocross action. Race powerful dirt bikes across rugged circuits carved into valleys, cliffs, and high mountain terrain. From dry dusty trails to rain-slick and stormy tracks, every race is a test of skill, reflex, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/57100e08d1e3ea673d81e7f94b14e02f.poster.avif?t=1769835322\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/57100e08d1e3ea673d81e7f94b14e02f.webm?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/57100e08d1e3ea673d81e7f94b14e02f.mp4?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your limits on twisting circuits built for thrill junkies, where every corner, jump, and obstacle matters. Master the changing weather, adapt your riding style, and prove you\u2019re the fastest rider on every terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/8257c2a80bc6067982ef09c2f1cf0e04.poster.avif?t=1769835322\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/8257c2a80bc6067982ef09c2f1cf0e04.webm?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/8257c2a80bc6067982ef09c2f1cf0e04.mp4?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Offroad Racing</strong> \u2013 Dirt bike circuits designed with rugged off-road paths while keeping the competitive racing feel. Experience dirt bike racing on circuits track design with off road stunts. Each lap of MX Racing World riding throws dust and rugged terrain challenge your control and test your limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments</strong> \u2013 Race on tracks set in valleys, mountains, and wild outdoor arenas. Compete in dirt racing tracks set in outdoor locations, from low valleys to towering mountainsides. Each environment is designed to push riders with steep climbs, sharp descents, and rugged turns that keeps every race intense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Weather Conditions</strong> \u2013 Compete through sunny, rainy, and stormy weather, each affecting track grip and visibility. Adapt to changing climates as you battle through sunny afternoons,rains, and clear skies. from slippery mud to dust clouds, forcing you to change strategies mid-race and master all climate conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/30f627b9518f10913982346e914d3910.poster.avif?t=1769835322\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/30f627b9518f10913982346e914d3910.webm?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/30f627b9518f10913982346e914d3910.mp4?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Multiple Racing Circuits</strong> \u2013 From tight twisting loops to wide open mountain runs, each track has seprate racing strategies. Race across a variety of circuits with speed and technical difficulty. Race in wide open tracks with jumps, each circuit feels unique and pushes you to adapt your racing style for victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/cf5a9b13aebcc10db8fa58c44239987a.poster.avif?t=1769835322\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/cf5a9b13aebcc10db8fa58c44239987a.webm?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/cf5a9b13aebcc10db8fa58c44239987a.mp4?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>High-Intensity Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Feel the thrill of dirt and speed as you push your bike to its limits. Every race is a fight against both the terrain and your rivals. Feel the intensity of wheel-to-wheel battles, land massive jumps, and power-slide through corners while trying to stay upright on unforgiving dirt surfaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/4deb192f94dce7a56c82e3f05512f081.poster.avif?t=1769835322\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/4deb192f94dce7a56c82e3f05512f081.webm?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/4deb192f94dce7a56c82e3f05512f081.mp4?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Immersive Visuals &amp; Effects</strong> \u2013 Realistic offroad details and weather effects bring every circuit to adventure. With race track details, and high-altitude mountain circuits, every race feels alive. The combination of dust, and dynamic lighting creates a offroad racing atmosphere that pulls you into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/5e5dda3367d9da7aac42e4961922b991.poster.avif?t=1769835322\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/5e5dda3367d9da7aac42e4961922b991.webm?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/5e5dda3367d9da7aac42e4961922b991.mp4?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the challenge awaits\u00a0It\u2019s not just racing, it\u2019s survival on two wheels take on the dirt and own the track\u00a0Gear up, hit the rugged trails, and prove you\u2019re the ultimate offroad rider</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/3fd2f0f0eee3a2391b7401e691adb06c.poster.avif?t=1769835322\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/3fd2f0f0eee3a2391b7401e691adb06c.webm?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975740/extras/3fd2f0f0eee3a2391b7401e691adb06c.mp4?t=1769835322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"h